planningNotes.codebaseInsights:
- executionAdmissionRefusal (util/claimEligibility.ts:70) is the single admission predicate. Its callers:
  - claimNextTask.ts:519 (the explicit claim throws);
  - claimNextTask.ts:577 (the ranked pool skips);
  - waitForTask.ts:152 (own held match) and :200 (the candidate filter).
- The ranked pool must skip, never throw: the sh wrapper reads a throw as a dead daemon (claimNextTask.ts:568-576).
- claim_next_task's inputSchema already carries runner identity fields (host, processStartedAt) that moe-proxy stamps; the proxy passes unknown args through.
